OL,4,G0100FMeeting Jack
OL,5,     GIn 1908, the author Jack London
OL,6,     Gand his wife sailed round the
OL,7,     GSouth Pacific in search of
OL,8,     Gadventure. Stars William Hope.
OL,9,G0230FPaddington Bear (Omnibus)
OL,10,     GWith the arrival of a furry
OL,11,     GPeruvian, life will never be the
OL,12,     Gsame again for the Browns. Stars
OL,13,     GMichael Hordern and Andrew Branch.
OL,14,G0335FInheritance Tracks
OL,15,     GPaddington Bear's creator chooses
OL,16,     G'The Laughing Policeman' by
OL,17,     GCharles Penrose and 'All Or
OL,18,     GNothing At All' by Frank Sinatra.
